{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Tower Defense with Roguelike Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough presents a unique challenge. Build defensive systems, combine modules, and adapt to randomized enemy waves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flexible Tower Building System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Tower Types</strong> - From classic archer towers to magical spires that crush enemies with arcane might</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhancement Modules</strong> - Boost tower stats and unlock new abilities:<br>\u2022 Stunning projectiles<br>\u2022 Arcane whirlwinds<br>\u2022 And many other devastating spells</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temporary Power-ups</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Runes</strong> - Boost tower combat stats: damage, attack speed and other parameters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Enemies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Enemy Factions</strong> - Each with distinct tactics and unit types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Bosses</strong> - Formidable foes requiring special strategies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Progression System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talent Tree</strong> - Permanent upgrades for your defenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archetypes</strong> - Special playstyles unlocked through progression</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Economy and Upgrades</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop</strong> - Upgrade and combine modules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market</strong> - Acquire new modules and resources</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap